### Authentication
# Define `access_token` in tests/rest/http-client.private.env.json. For example:
# {
#   "dev": {
#     "access_token": "<Daily Wire access token>"
#   }
# }

### Get episode details
@access_token = variable value
GET https://middleware-prod.dailywire.com/middleware/v4/getEpisode?slug=ep-2324-the-trump-administration-cracks-down-on-third-world-migration
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


