    ?slug=the-ben-shapiro-show
    &membershipPlan=ALL_ACCESS
    &orderBy=CreatedAt_DESC
    &pageNumber=1
    &pageSize=20
    &showOffset=0
    &podcastOffset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


